# .worktreeinclude — gitignored files Claude Code copies into each new worktree.
#
# A worktree is a fresh checkout, so gitignored local files (agent guardrails,
# working notes) are absent unless listed here. Uses .gitignore syntax; only
# files that match AND are gitignored AND present get copied — tracked files are
# never duplicated, and a public clone (which has none of these) is unaffected.
#
# Note: SYMLINKS are not copied, so AGENTS.md (→ CLAUDE.md) won't appear in a
# worktree — but tools that read AGENTS.md fall back to CLAUDE.md, which IS
# tracked and therefore present. So it's intentionally not listed here.

# Host-local agent guardrails (host safety + agent-tool routing)
CLAUDE.local.md

# Reverse-engineering working notes + the validation battery
scratch/
